---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | DonanimKlinik"
  description="DonanimKlinik privacy policy — how we handle data, cookies, and advertising on this site."
  canonical="https://www.donanimklinik.com/privacy/"
>

<div class="page-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      <span aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="page-title display">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">Last updated: September 2026</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="article-body" style="padding-top: 40px;">

    <h2>1. Overview</h2>
    <p>DonanimKlinik ("we", "us", "our") operates the website donanimklinik.com. This page informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data when you use our site, and the choices you have associated with that data.</p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We do not directly collect personally identifiable information unless you contact us voluntarily. However, third-party services we use may collect certain data automatically:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — collects anonymised usage data (pages visited, time on site, general location). You can opt out via <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's opt-out tool</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — serves advertisements and may use cookies to show personalised ads based on your browsing history. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's ad policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site uses cookies through third-party services (Google Analytics, Google AdSense). Cookies are small data files stored on your device. You can control cookies through your browser settings or via Google's <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ad Settings</a>.</p>

    <h2>4. Advertising</h2>
    <p>We use Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You may opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.</p>
    <p>We do not control the content of advertisements displayed on this site.</p>

    <h2>5. Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>Our articles link to official manufacturer and software documentation pages. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those external sites. We recommend reading their privacy policies.</p>

    <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

    <h2>7. Your Rights (GDPR / CCPA)</h2>
    <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, correct, or delete data held about you by third-party services. Please refer to Google's privacy controls for data held by Google Analytics and AdSense.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected by updating the date at the top of this page.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>For any privacy-related questions, please use the contact details on our <a href="/about">About page</a>.</p>

  </div>
</div>

</Layout>
